sis)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 158.02 Td /TT0 11.82 Tf (has shown. This emphasizes how crucial it is to put specific safety measures in place on these kinds of roads, like better signage, speed limit)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 143.54 Td /TT0 11.82 Tf (enforcement, and infrastructure upgrades, in order to increase overall safety and lessen the severity of incidents.)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 129.06 Td /TT0 11.82 Tf (Ä)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 114.59 Td /TT0 11.82 Tf (4.)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 9.53 114.59 Td /TT3 11.82 Tf ( Day-Specific Traffic Safety Measures:)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 205.58 114.59 Td /TT0 11.82 Tf (ÄFridays consistently see the highest number of accidents and fatalities, so there's a chance to use day-)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 100.11 Td /TT0 11.82 Tf (specific traffic safety protocols. This might entail stepped-up law enforcement presence on Fridays, public awareness campaigns, and focused)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 85.63 Td /TT0 11.82 Tf (initiatives meant to curb risky behaviors. Adapting interventions to particular days of the week can help develop accident prevention plans that are)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 71.15 Td /TT0 11.82 Tf (more successful.)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 56.67 Td /TT0 11.82 Tf (Ä)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 42.19 Td /TT0 11.82 Tf (5.)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 9.53 42.19 Td /TT3 11.82 Tf ( Provide Safety Initiatives Exclusive to a Province:)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 267.34 42.19 Td /TT0 11.82 Tf ( The provincia